After one call of handle, what does the next render show for n?

```jsx
const [n, setN] = useState(0);
function handle() {
  setN(n + 1);
  setN(n + 1);
}
```

After one call of handle from n = 0, what does the next render show for n?

```jsx
function handle() {
  setN(p => p + 1);
  setN(p => p + 1);
}
```
